  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CSSF YEMEN : SUPPORT TO GENERAL SECRETARIAT</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ASI, in partnership with Deeproot Consulting, delivered Pilot Interventions to Support Yemen&#x2019;s General Secretariat, on behalf of the FCDO. The pilot projects were of critical importance in strengthening the institutional capacity of the Secretariat and improve the decision-making process for the Council of Ministers (CoM).</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Pilots were focused on achieving the four goals set by the Secretary-General, and incorporated:

- improved organisation at the CoM;
- enhanced capacity to monitor and implement Government decisions;
- restructuring the General Secretariat; and
- developing the skills of the Secretariat&#x2019;s workforce.</narrative>
  </description>
